OrangeIslands_Kinnow_HarbourOffice_Text_Harbourmaster::
	.string "KINNOW HARBOUR OFFICE. I book the\n"
	.string "pier and I settle the arguments\l"
	.string "about it.\p"
	.string "The long jetty at the south end\n"
	.string "is not ours. That berth is\l"
	.string "spoken for.$"

OrangeIslands_Kinnow_HarbourOffice_Text_Clerk2::
	.string "Trainers come off ROUTE 9 and walk\n"
	.string "straight back down the pier.\p"
	.string "Whatever is moored there, they\n"
	.string "want it more than they want us.$"

